# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rwanda Rental Platform — Backend configuration (EXAMPLE / DOCUMENTATION)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This backend runs on Cloudflare Workers. Configuration is provided in two
# places, NOT via a runtime-loaded .env file:
#
#   1) Non-secret vars  -> wrangler.jsonc  ("vars" block)
#   2) Secrets          -> `.dev.vars` locally (git-ignored),
#                          `wrangler secret put <NAME>` for deployed envs
#
# This file documents every value the app expects. Copy secret entries into a
# local `.dev.vars` file (see `.dev.vars.example`). Never commit real secrets.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Non-secret vars (declared in wrangler.jsonc -> "vars"):
#   ENVIRONMENT   development | test | production
#   FRONTEND_URL  Allowed CORS origin (the frontend app), e.g. http://localhost:3000
ENVIRONMENT=development
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Cloudflare bindings (declared in wrangler.jsonc, not here):
#   DB      -> Cloudflare D1 database (SQLite)         [binding name: DB]
#   ASSETS  -> Cloudflare R2 bucket (object storage)   [binding name: ASSETS]
#
# Secrets: none required in Phase B0-R. Future phases (e.g. payment providers)
# will add secrets via `.dev.vars` / `wrangler secret put`.
